<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto pickup needed</Major>
    <Description>Rebuild of the previous version, now walks only up and down to prevent going out of digimons sight

Macro to auto farm in places like silver lake lillymon, small, full of digimon and no one nearby
You will need auto pickup for it to work
You also need a strong digimon to one shot, otherwise it will take some time</Description>
